   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronouns in the dative function",
     "texto": [
      "The dative often answers the question **to whom?** (**Wem?**).",
      "Key forms: **mir** (to me), **dir** (to you), **ihm** (to him / to it, neuter), **ihr** (to her), **uns** (to us), **euch** (to you, plural), **ihnen** (to them) and **Ihnen** (to you, formal).",
      "Verbs that always take the dative: **Die Ärztin hilft mir** (the doctor helps me); **Ich danke Ihnen** (I thank you); **Der Tee tut ihr gut** (the tea does her good)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
